      "writtenOn": "2019-03-07T17:42:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Active comes from mkbp it is more important in the GPIO in order to set or clear the interrupt line. In our case we only care if the event is set and take no action when it is cleared.\n\nI added the mkbp_set_host_active_via_custom here because it is the board that defines CONFIG_MKBP_USE_CUSTOM so this seemed like the right level of abstraction.",
      "parentUuid": "50da9427_b90d8b90",
